r-element-53cb1a2 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-gap-beside-yes elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-column-vertical-align-stretch\" data-id=\"53cb1a2\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-601d554\" data-id=\"601d554\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a4f9eb3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a4f9eb3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><i>\u201c Engineering in the 21st century is much different from what it used to be. Today, it requires adjusting to the fast-paced world and keeping up with development.\u201d __Anastasia Moore.\u00a0<\/i><\/p><p>Engineering has played an important role in our real-world innovation. At CamTech, we aim to provide our students with the best learning experience through the integration of scientific theories with project-based learning to solve real-world problems and create innovative entrepreneurial solutions that benefit humanity .<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-da26c3c elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"da26c3c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-eda81a5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"eda81a5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Mission<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0bb18ca elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0bb18ca\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\n \t<li><strong>Educate engineers<\/strong>: combining strong technical knowledge with a holistic, social conscience, incorporating the principles of system approach engineering with values such as community-centered knowledge to ensure engineering focus on sustainable development of society.\nEngage in research: learning through collaboration with industry, which is enhanced by external funding and collaboration and contribution of high-quality graduate students.<\/li>\n \t<li><strong><strong>Pursuit for entrepreneurship<\/strong><\/strong>: providing the opportunities in our research, infrastructure, resource and learning to ensure maximum impact throughout the community and beyond.<\/li>\n \t<li><strong>Pursuit for engineering knowledge that will serve our communities<\/strong>: through the practical application of engineering designs and products development by fought-year engineering students&#8217; project based study.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-f6cf179\" data-id=\"f6cf179\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-643501d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"643501d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Learning Objectives<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6cdea11 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6cdea11\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\n<li>To promote an entrepreneurial spirit and to consider the option of setting up a company as an employment opportunity<\/li>\n<li>Development of entrepreneurial skills and use of tools that equip people to work in an entrepreneurial project<\/li>\n<li>Essential knowledge for those interested in managing their own business<\/li>\n<\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-38c7d2d elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"38c7d2d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cfb3c9a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"cfb3c9a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>VISION<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-06c076b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"06c076b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The Faculty of Engineering will strive to be a dynamic center of<span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); letter-spacing: 0em;\">\u00a0e<\/span><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); letter-spacing: 0em;\">ngineering, innovation and creativity dedicated to teaching, lifelong learning, professionalism, research, entrepreneurship and partnership with local and global to grantee Cambodia&#8217;s future prosperity.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-53d8772 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"53d8772\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bf547fd elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"bf547fd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>VALUE<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6a9f8b0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6a9f8b0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Professionalism, Exellence, Intergrity and Innovation<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-21a4cf4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"21a4cf4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1379a2a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1379a2a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>FRAMEWORK<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4f4d2fe elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4f4d2fe\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The program of the Faculty of Engineering (FENG) aims to continue from the foundation year to strengthen student general knowledge of various fields, such mathematics, science, arts, humanities, in addition to their specialization. To ensure the objective of FENG, a Connected Curriculum Framework will be adopted for program in faculty.\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-ec616a8\" data-id=\"ec616a8\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5762893 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5762893\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>contact<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-aa9e557 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"aa9e557\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><b>Dr. May Thu<br \/>Dean of Engineering<br \/><a href=\"mailto:admissions@camtech.edu.kh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">admissions@camtech.edu.kh<\/a>\u00a0 \u00a0<br \/>+855 78 212 181 (Telegram)\u00a0<br \/><\/b><b>+855 86 212 181 (Telegram)\u00a0<br \/><\/b><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-c02f6d2 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-gap-beside-yes elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-column-vertical-align-stretch\" data-id=\"c02f6d2\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-33d0a29\" data-id=\"33d0a29\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6b20a53 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"6b20a53\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-920f266 elementor-section-gap-beside-no elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-column-vertical-align-stretch\" data-id=\"920f266\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-custom\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-b023dda\" data-id=\"b023dda\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4bbaded elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"4bbaded\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f069173 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f069173\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-xl\">FACULTY OF ENGINEERING INTERCONNECTED CURRICULUM FRAMEWORK <\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f5aa64e elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"f5aa64e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c991b31 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"c991b31\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"512\" height=\"237\" src=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/Engineering.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-19370\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/Engineering.png 512w, https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/Engineering-300x139.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5203916 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"5203916\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fbe151d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"fbe151d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol>\n \t<li><strong><b>Students connected with researchers and within the institute\u2019s research:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> inviting students to connect with research at the start of the foundation year program to the end of their program in each major. Researchers are also encouraged to mentor students in the area of their research.<\/span><\/strong><\/li>\n \t<li><b>A throughout of research activities is built into each programme:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> each programme of study is designed in such a way that students experience a connected sequence of learning activities and empower them, step by step using researching method of inquiry. <\/span><\/li>\n \t<li><b>Students make connections across subjects and out to the world:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> provide a platform for students to learn with other students and scholars including and from\u00a0 outside of their main subject field. <\/span><\/li>\n \t<li><b>Students connected academic learning with workplace learning:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u00a0 internship will be part of curriculum for every academic year. Students are encouraged to do their internship in university research groups, startups and outside related firms.<\/span><\/li>\n \t<li><b>Students learn to produce outputs-assessment directed at an audience:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> student\u2019s work is not only being assessed by other students and faculty members,\u00a0 the international and local community will also participate in the process. Students are encouraged to engage in digital communication skills. <\/span><\/li>\n \t<li><b>Students connected with each other across phases and with alumni:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> program allows students to connect with each other across discipline and with alumni. Peer mentoring and students club body will be important for faculty academic programs and activities. <\/span><\/li>\n<\/ol>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6645da3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"6645da3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f7d497a elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f7d497a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-xl\">PROGRAM STRUCTURE OF BACHELOR OF ENGINEERING<\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5d73831 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"5d73831\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-49fecaf e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"49fecaf\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-28928a6 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"28928a6\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f0e0369 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f0e0369\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data