TRUCTURE OF THE PROFESSIONAL DOPLOMA PROGRAM<\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-098a5b0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"098a5b0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6d74d31 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6d74d31\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>The Professional Diploma Program (PDP)\u00a0<\/strong>at Cambodia University of Technology and Science (CamTech) is designed for a career-focused, accomplished associate degree or the equivalent. Student enrolled in the Professional Diploma will elevate their focus expertise\u00a0 to a professional level and learn critical skills in entrepreneurship, freelancing work, and other business-related skills. PDP provides a passway to a full bachelor\u2019s program after students complete the program and fulfill the requirements for their chosen major. Students enrolled in this program will identify a focus area that complements their major area studies and supports the development of their professional goals. This program gives students the opportunity to deepen and expand their readiness to enter and be leaders within ever-changing specialties by broadening their skill sets and access to a variety of techniques ready for work. Their coursework will prepare them to engage in repertoire planning that demands more diversity in programming, addressing current needs and gaps in the professional world. The program includes a career-focused seminar, core coursework, and student-selected job placement learning, in addition to private lessons, large ensembles, and elective courses. The 2-year Professional Diploma program contains 80 credits combining 70 credits of specialized coursework and 12 credits of internship and 4 credits for the final diploma project report.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7b61587 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"7b61587\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-88a7eae elementor-widget elementor-widget-Table\" data-id=\"88a7eae\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"Table.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<table class=\"tafe-table\">\n\t\t\t<thead  class=\"tafe-table-header\">\n\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t<th class=\"elementor-inline-editing elementor-repeater-item-b833bce\"   >No.<\/th><th class=\"elementor-inline-editing elementor-repeater-item-6e11074\"   >Course<\/th><th class=\"elementor-inline-editing elementor-repeater-item-2a9c31d\"   >Number of Course<\/th><th class=\"elementor-inline-editing elementor-repeater-item-a49a75c\"   >Number of Credit<\/th>\t\t\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t\t<\/thead>\n\t\t\t<tbody class=\"tafe-table-body\">\n\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t<td   class=\"elementor-repeater-item-28cb243 td-content-type-default\" >1<\/td><td   class=\"elementor-repeater-item-9d0f805 td-content-type-default\" >Specialized courses<\/td><td   class=\"elementor-repeater-item-1af86b8 td-content-type-default\" >33<\/td><td   class=\"elementor-repeater-item-46a5b0b td-content-type-default\" >64<\/td><\/tr><tr><td   class=\"elementor-repeater-item-18178cb td-content-type-default\" >2<\/td><td   class=\"elementor-repeater-item-343da43 td-content-type-default\" >Internship in industrial  including year 1-2<\/td><td   class=\"elementor-repeater-item-f60c57f td-content-type-default\" >6<\/td><td   class=\"elementor-repeater-item-896feaa td-content-type-default\" >12<\/td><\/tr><tr><t